 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to Canada increased from 54.6 million euros in 2005 to 122.2 million euros in 2025.",
  "Exports to Canada grew by 123.8% over this period, with the peak export value reaching 124.8 million euros in 2021.",
  "The largest year-to-year increase for exports to Canada was between 2013 and 2014, rising from 68.3 million euros to 105.6 million euros.",
  "Exports to India rose from 14.8 million euros in 2005 to 64.2 million euros in 2025, showing a growth of 332.8%.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for inflation or price changes, which may affect the interpretation of growth over time."
 ],
